settings-entry-description-system-se-volume = Adjusts the volume of menu and screen-transition sound effects.
settings-entry-description-input-offset = Shifts input judgement timing relative to the audio.
settings-entry-description-visual-offset = Shifts note display timing relative to the audio.
settings-entry-description-visual-offset-auto-adjust = Automatically adjusts the visual offset from recent judgement timing.
settings-entry-description-judge-algorithm = Chooses which note takes priority when judgement candidates overlap in one lane.
settings-entry-description-fast-slow-display-scope = Chooses whether FAST/SLOW follows judgement type or a PGREAT timing-difference threshold.
settings-entry-description-fast-slow-display-threshold = Sets the minimum PGREAT timing difference shown as FAST/SLOW in THRESHOLD mode.
settings-entry-description-rule-mode = Chooses the rules used for judgement, gauges, and score calculation.
settings-entry-description-ln-mode-policy = Chooses how LN, CN, and HCN objects are interpreted.
settings-entry-description-gauge = Chooses the gauge used at the start of play.
settings-entry-description-gauge-auto-shift = Chooses how the game switches gauges according to gauge state.
settings-entry-description-bottom-shiftable-gauge = Chooses the lowest gauge available to gauge auto-shift.
settings-entry-description-random = Chooses how notes are arranged on the applicable player side.
settings-entry-description-double-option = Chooses how the left and right lane groups are swapped in DP charts.
settings-entry-description-hs-fix = Chooses the BPM used as the hispeed basis during BPM changes.
settings-entry-description-target = Chooses the target score used for comparison during play.
settings-entry-description-assist = Chooses features that assist play.
settings-entry-description-bga-mode = Chooses how BGA is displayed during play.
settings-entry-description-bga-expand = Chooses how BGA is scaled to fit its display area.
settings-entry-description-auto-play = Switches to play that automatically performs notes.
settings-entry-description-session-mode = Chooses normal, practice, autoplay, or one of the battle play modes.
settings-entry-description-key-mode-conversion = Converts compatible charts to DP, 9K, or 6K for play.
settings-entry-description-seven-to-nine-pattern = Chooses the scratch and key layout used when converting 7K to 9K.
settings-entry-description-seven-to-nine-type = Chooses how notes are assigned to the added lanes in 7K-to-9K conversion.
settings-entry-description-seven-to-nine-rule-mode = Chooses whether converted 7K-to-9K play uses 7K or 9K judgement and gauge rules.
settings-entry-description-play-exit-hold = Sets how long E1 and E2 must be held to exit during play.
settings-entry-description-assist-expand-judge = Allows individual judge-window rates to widen or narrow judgement timing.
settings-entry-description-assist-judge-area = Displays the judgeable area on the lanes.
settings-entry-description-assist-mark-note = Marks notes added by conversion or assist processing.
settings-entry-description-assist-bpm-guide = Displays BPM change positions on the lanes.
settings-entry-description-assist-scroll-mode = Chooses whether SCROLL changes are removed or added.
settings-entry-description-assist-long-note-mode = Removes long notes or adds the selected type of long note.
settings-entry-description-assist-mine-mode = Removes mines or adds them at the selected kind of position.
settings-entry-description-assist-scroll-section = Sets the number of chart sections used when adding SCROLL changes.
settings-entry-description-assist-scroll-rate = Sets the chance of adding a SCROLL change to each section.
settings-entry-description-assist-long-note-rate = Sets the chance of converting an eligible note into a long note.
settings-entry-description-assist-extra-note-depth = Sets how many neighboring notes are considered when generating extra notes.
settings-entry-description-assist-extra-note-scratch = Includes scratch notes when generating extra notes.
settings-entry-description-assist-extra-note-type = Chooses the extra-note method reserved for beatoraja compatibility.
settings-entry-description-assist-key-judge-rate = Sets the corresponding key judge window as a percentage of its normal width.
settings-entry-description-assist-scratch-judge-rate = Sets the corresponding scratch judge window as a percentage of its normal width.
settings-entry-description-assist-long-note-margin-rate = Sets the long-note end margin as a percentage of its normal width.
settings-entry-description-misslayer-duration = Sets how long the miss BGA layer remains visible.
settings-entry-description-note-retention = Keeps unjudged normal notes at the judgment line until they are processed.
settings-entry-description-show-ln-tail-cap = Toggles the dedicated cap that marks the end of an LN.
settings-entry-description-guide-se = Toggles the guide sound that indicates judgement timing.
settings-entry-description-hispeed = Adjusts the Classic hispeed multiplier.
settings-entry-description-hispeed-mode = Chooses a combination of Normal, Classic, and Floating.
settings-entry-description-normal-hispeed-level = Chooses one of the 20 Normal hispeed levels.
settings-entry-description-classic-hispeed-step = Sets the Classic hispeed multiplier adjustment step.
settings-entry-description-floating-hispeed-step = Sets the Floating hispeed multiplier adjustment step.
settings-entry-description-sudden-enabled = Enables the SUDDEN+ lane cover.
settings-entry-description-sudden = Adjusts how much of the upper lane area is hidden.
settings-entry-description-lift-enabled = Enables moving the judgement line upward with LIFT.
settings-entry-description-lift = Adjusts how far the judgement line is moved upward.
settings-entry-description-hispeed-auto-adjust = Automatically adjusts hispeed to preserve display time after LIFT or lane-cover changes.
settings-entry-description-hidden-enabled = Enables the HIDDEN+ lane cover.
settings-entry-description-hidden = Adjusts the area near the judgement line where notes are hidden.
settings-entry-description-target-green-number = Sets the note display time targeted by automatic hispeed adjustment.
settings-entry-description-note-display-duration = Sets the time window in which notes are visible when CONSTANT is used.
settings-entry-description-constant = Keeps note display time constant regardless of BPM changes.
settings-entry-description-constant-fade = Sets the note fade duration at the edge of the CONSTANT display range.
settings-entry-description-select-input-mode = Chooses the input method used on the Select screen.
settings-entry-description-analog-scratch = Treats controller scratch input as analog rotation.
settings-entry-description-analog-scratch-sensitivity = Adjusts sensitivity to analog scratch rotation.
settings-entry-description-analog-scratch-threshold = Sets how long until an analog scratch is considered stopped.
settings-entry-description-analog-ticks-per-scroll = Sets the analog rotation required to move the Select list by one row.
settings-entry-description-keyboard-release-bounce = Filters duplicate input from the same key immediately after release.
settings-entry-description-controller-release-bounce = Filters duplicate input from the same button immediately after release.
settings-entry-description-hispeed-direction = Chooses the direction in which the corresponding key changes hispeed.
settings-entry-description-difficulty-table-level-display = Chooses the level notation shown inside difficulty table folders.
settings-entry-description-random-select = Adds a random selection item to the Select list.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-target-level = Sets the chart level used as the center of a random course.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-max-level = Sets the highest chart level allowed in a random course.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-min-level = Sets the lowest chart level allowed in a random course.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-bpm-range = Sets the allowed BPM difference within a random course.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-max-bpm = Sets the highest chart BPM allowed in a random course.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-min-bpm = Sets the lowest chart BPM allowed in a random course.
settings-entry-description-random-mix-stages = Sets the number of songs in a random course.
settings-entry-description-replay-auto-save = Automatically saves a replay when play ends.
settings-entry-description-replay-compress = Compresses saved replay data to reduce file size.
settings-entry-description-replay-slot-rule = Chooses the condition for saving to the corresponding replay slot.
settings-entry-description-language = Chooses the display language used by the game UI and setting descriptions.
settings-entry-description-show-fps = Toggles the on-screen FPS display.
settings-entry-description-audio-backend = Chooses the OS or driver backend used for audio output.
settings-entry-description-audio-output-mode = Chooses shared, low-latency shared, or exclusive WASAPI output. Reopen audio with Apply after changing it.
settings-entry-description-audio-sample-rate = Chooses the driver default or a fixed output sample rate.
settings-entry-description-audio-buffer-mode = Chooses whether the driver selects the audio buffer or a fixed frame count is used.
settings-entry-description-audio-buffer-size = Sets the fixed audio buffer frame count. Smaller values reduce latency but increase dropout risk.
settings-entry-description-audio-output-device = Chooses the output device. The current device list is loaded when editing starts.
settings-entry-description-audio-asio-driver = Chooses the ASIO driver. The current driver list is loaded when editing starts.
settings-entry-description-audio-output-channel = Chooses the stereo channel pair used on a multichannel ASIO device.
settings-entry-description-video-window-mode = Chooses windowed, borderless fullscreen, or exclusive fullscreen display.
settings-entry-description-video-window-size = Sets the window width or height used after the next launch.
settings-entry-description-video-internal-resolution = Chooses whether rendering uses the window resolution or the current skin resolution.
settings-entry-description-video-monitor = Chooses the display used for fullscreen. Changes apply after the next launch.
settings-entry-description-video-vsync = Chooses the GPU present mode to balance tearing and display latency.
settings-entry-description-video-frame-latency = Chooses the number of in-flight surface frames to balance latency and stability.
settings-entry-description-video-target-fps = Sets the foreground target FPS. Zero disables the frame limit.
settings-entry-description-video-background-fps = Sets the FPS limit while the window is inactive.
settings-entry-description-video-renderer = Chooses the GPU rendering backend. Changes apply after the next launch.
settings-key-binding-description = Assigns the input used for an action or lane.

